    <description>RCA workflow stage engine. When all tasks of an RCA stage (Type__c = Investigation/Remediation/Verification) are complete, stamp that stage&#39;s completed date and advance Stage__c to the next stage. When Verification completes the RCA is resolved: the Closed Completed Date is stamped and Stage__c is set to Closed (there are no Closed tasks). Mirrors the standard &quot;Set Completed Dates &amp; Change Stage v2&quot; flow but keyed off RCA-specific completion fields, so it only fires for RCA onboardings. (INC3-30)</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
